{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/05/7310323/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近かわいいお面見つけたんだよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえばおとといは\n節分の日でしたね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恵方巻きちゃんと南南東向いて\n食べたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/05/7310323/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"豆もちゃんと年の数食べたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/05/7310323/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...っていう報告。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにお面はリアルなヒツジさん。\nきもかわいい！部屋に飾る。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウサギとヒツジで迷ったから\nスタッフさんに\n「私ってどっちと似てますか？」\nって聞いたらヒツジだって"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/05/7310323/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...め～め～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー部屋片付けたいな。\n家帰ったらすぐ部屋片付けよっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...うがい手洗いしてからね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/05/7310323/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー学校のノートうつさなきゃだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『KANAZAWA GIRLS\nFESTIVAL２０１３』に\n出演することになりました♪\n嬉しい><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕張メッセもあるし...楽しみです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/05/7310323/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"からだ引き締めなきゃ。\nおもっきし動きたいなあ。\n踊り狂いたいなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/05/7310323/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっき車の中で撮った笑\nメイクは薄いのに\nなんか濃く見えるね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！今おっきいくしゃみ出て\nめっちゃすっきりした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うわ！やっばいすっきり！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではおやすみなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}